cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Use the preferred citation for the two PDF manuscripts. Cite the upstream
  references for the underlying proof and Lean formalization.
title: "A Theta-Lattice Proof of the Dirichlet Generalized Riemann Hypothesis [AI-generated bilingual reconstruction]"
authors:
  - name: "ChatGPT"
abstract: >-
  ChatGPT generated these English and Simplified Chinese manuscripts as a
  natural-language reconstruction of the proposed proof of the Generalized
  Riemann Hypothesis for Dirichlet L-functions. The manuscripts are research
  drafts. The upstream project credits the underlying proof to Levent
  Alpöge working with Claude and provides a shorter Lean 4 formalization.
url: "https://github.com/TranswarpDrive/grh_full_proof"
